Regular spend earns the full 3%; promotional rates (e.g., 15% food bonus) are temporary and posted in advance.	Regular spend earns 3% within the first band of the month; above that band the rate steps down to 1% and then 0.5%.
Typical: ~$120/month ($75 from 15% food promo on $500 + $45 from 3% base on $1,500).	Typical: ~$60/month (3% across the first $2,000 of monthly spend, before the rate steps down).
